      "finding": "MacRumors, iCulture, and iMore describe July 9 as the first/PB1 public appearance, while retained Forbes and Redmond Pie material treat the earlier public payload as Public Beta 2 and July 23 as Public Beta 3. Appearance count and displayed/build-aligned label are not safely interchangeable.",
