      ],
      "affectedNotProposedRecordIds": [
        "not-proposed:apple:ios:15.0:public-beta-3"
      ],
      "finding": "MacRumors, iCulture, iMore, and iDownloadBlog count the June 30 and July 16 appearances as first/PB1 and second/PB2. Forbes labels those payloads Public Beta 2 and Public Beta 3, Wccftech labels July 16 Public Beta 3, and retained contemporary MacRumors comments report that the download itself displayed Public Beta 3. The packet cannot resolve official label identity by choosing appearance order.",
      "unblockEvidence": "Capture a contemporaneous Apple update screen, catalog, profile artifact, or other direct label evidence for both June 30 and July 16 before retaining or correcting the three affected identities."
    },
