        "candidate:apple:ios:17.0:public-beta-6"
      ],
      "finding": "iCulture explicitly establishes Public Beta 6 on August 29. The retained MacRumors page establishes an August 29 public update but calls only the developer payload Beta 8; it never identifies the public update as Public Beta 6.",
      "unblockEvidence": "Capture a second independent source that explicitly says iOS 17 Public Beta 6 was available on August 29, 2023."
    },
    {
      "findingId": "ios18-pb5-triangulation-not-exact-corroboration",
      "severity": "blocking",
      "sourceIds": [
        "iculture-ios18",
        "mr-ios18-pb5",
        "osxd-ios18-pb5"
      ],
      "affectedCandidateIds": [
        "candidate:apple:ios:18.0:public-beta-5"
      ],
      "finding": "iCulture alone states the full identity Public Beta 5 on August 20. MacRumors establishes August 20 public availability but not Public Beta 5, while OS X Daily explicitly identifies Public Beta 5 but dates its report and claimed issue to August 21. Those sources triangulate the event but do not provide two independent exact version/ordinal/August 20 lineages.",
      "unblockEvidence": "Capture a second independent source explicitly establishing iOS 18 Public Beta 5 on August 20 Pacific, or direct timestamped Apple evidence that resolves the August 20 versus August 21 appearance date."
